  "notable_quotes": [
    "These Ln–Zn HCPs are the first reported from Hatz and oxalate co-ligands and the highest-nuclearity Hatz example reported to date.",
    "The compounds form 3D pillar-layered frameworks with a 5-nodal net; the authors describe them as 5-nodal (3,4,6,7,8)-connected topologies.",
    "In the solvothermal process, Hatz forms by decarboxylation of 3-amino-1,2,4-triazole-5-carboxylic acid; IR shows complete carboxylate deprotonation."
